{"children":[{"nodeType":18,"text":"经典比特（Bit）与量子比特（Qubit）是经典计算与量子计算的最核心物理与信息单元。两者在计算范式上有着本质区别："},{"nodeType":17,"rows":[{"cells":[{"children":[{"nodeType":18,"text":"对比维度"}]},{"children":[{"nodeType":18,"text":"经典比特 (Bit)"}]},{"children":[{"nodeType":18,"text":"量子比特 (Qubit)"}]}]},{"cells":[{"children":[{"nodeType":18,"text":"叠加态","annotations":[{"start":0,"end":3,"type":0}]}]},{"children":[{"nodeType":18,"text":"确定状态","annotations":[{"start":0,"end":4,"type":0}]},{"nodeType":13},{"nodeType":18,"text":"任意时刻只能处于确定的 0 或 1 状态。","annotations":[{"start":12,"end":13,"type":4},{"start":16,"end":17,"type":4}]}]},{"children":[{"nodeType":18,"text":"连续叠加","annotations":[{"start":0,"end":4,"type":0}]},{"nodeType":13},{"nodeType":18,"text":"可同时处于 0 与 1 的叠加态：","annotations":[{"start":6,"end":7,"type":4},{"start":10,"end":11,"type":4}]},{"nodeType":13},{"nodeType":18,"text":"\\Vert{}\\psi\\rangle = \\alpha\\Vert{}0\\rangle + \\beta\\Vert{}1\\rangle，其中 \\Vert{}\\alpha\\Vert{}^2 + \\Vert{}\\beta\\Vert{}^2 = 1。","annotations":[{"start":0,"end":65,"type":4},{"start":69,"end":119,"type":4}]}]}]},{"cells":[{"children":[{"nodeType":18,"text":"并行度","annotations":[{"start":0,"end":3,"type":0}]}]},{"children":[{"nodeType":18,"text":"线性扩展","annotations":[{"start":0,"end":4,"type":0}]},{"nodeType":13},{"nodeType":18,"text":"N 个经典比特在同一时刻只能表达 1 个确定状态，处理速度随比特数线性增长。","annotations":[{"start":0,"end":1,"type":4},{"start":17,"end":18,"type":4}]}]},{"children":[{"nodeType":18,"text":"指数级并行","annotations":[{"start":0,"end":5,"type":0}]},{"nodeType":13},{"nodeType":18,"text":"N 个处于纠缠叠加态的量子比特可同时表达 2^N 个状态，提供指数级计算空间。","annotations":[{"start":0,"end":1,"type":4},{"start":21,"end":24,"type":4}]}]}]},{"cells":[{"children":[{"nodeType":18,"text":"纠错难度","annotations":[{"start":0,"end":4,"type":0}]}]},{"children":[{"nodeType":18,"text":"极低（高鲁棒性）","annotations":[{"start":0,"end":8,"type":0}]},{"nodeType":13},{"nodeType":18,"text":"硬件实现通常基于高低电平，受热噪声等环境干扰小；纠错算法（如重复码）成熟且开销极低。"}]},{"children":[{"nodeType":18,"text":"极高（高脆弱性）","annotations":[{"start":0,"end":8,"type":0}]},{"nodeType":13},{"nodeType":18,"text":"极易受环境噪声干扰发生退相干（Decoherence）；根据非克隆定理，需要通过复杂的量子纠错码（如 Surface Code），且单个逻辑比特通常需要成百上千个物理比特支撑。"}]}]},{"cells":[{"children":[{"nodeType":18,"text":"应用场景","annotations":[{"start":0,"end":4,"type":0}]}]},{"children":[{"nodeType":18,"text":"通用基础计算","annotations":[{"start":0,"end":6,"type":0}]},{"nodeType":13},{"nodeType":18,"text":"日常逻辑运算、文档处理、数据库查询、网络通信、图像与音视频编解码等。"}]},{"children":[{"nodeType":18,"text":"特定难题破译与模拟","annotations":[{"start":0,"end":9,"type":0}]},{"nodeType":13},{"nodeType":18,"text":"大整数质因数分解（Shor算法）、复杂分子与量子材料模拟、组合优化问题、加速无序数据库搜索（Grover算法）等。"}]}]}]},{"nodeType":0,"Xj":[{"attachmentType":22,"Ze":"[Elicitations: 2]","Wg":0,"message":"想要进一步探索量子计算的相关概念，可以尝试以下方向：","items":[{"label":"了解量子退相干（Decoherence）的物理机制","query":"请详细解释量子退相干（Decoherence）的物理机制以及它是如何破坏量子叠加态的。","XW":""},{"label":"对比 Shor 算法与 Grover 算法的原理及加速效果","query":"请对比 Shor 算法与 Grover 算法的基本原理，以及它们相对于经典算法分别带来了怎样的加速效果。","XW":""}],"renderingType":"standard"}]}]}